*.pyc

# Session-specific CA bundle for the sandbox Docker build. Regenerate with
# `cp /root/.ccr/ca-bundle.crt bot/ccr-agent-proxy.crt` -- the proxy CA changes
# every session, so a committed copy is stale the moment it lands.
bot/ccr-agent-proxy.crt

# Downloaded coworld package (`coworld download ctf -o cwpkg`). Upstream
